<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Sandrela - Password Reset Code</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #121212;
      font-family: 'Helvetica', Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #ffffff;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #1e1e1e;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }
    h1 {
      color: #ff8800;
      font-size: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    p {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: #e0e0e0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .otp {
      display: block;
      margin: 25px auto;
      padding: 15px 30px;
      background-color: #ff8800;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: bold;
      border-radius: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #aaaaaa;
      text-align: center;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Sandrela</h1>
    <p>Hello, {{email}}</p>
    <p>We received a request to reset your password for your Sandrela account.<br>
       Use the OTP code below to complete the reset:</p>
    <div class="otp">{{otp}}</div>
    <p>If you did not request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
    <div class="footer">
      &copy; 2025 Sandrela. All rights reserved.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
